        "title": "国会议员简历底稿（2026年6月整理，仓库归档）",
        "published_at": "2026-06-13",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-22",
        "excerpt": "里克·克劳福德，男，1966年1月生，佛罗里达州霍姆斯特德空军基地人，大学学历，农业经济学学士学位，1985年1月参加工作，2010年5月加入美国共和党。",
        "tier": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "cdir1",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/app/details/CDIR-2026-02-20",
        "title": "Official Congressional Directory, 119th Congress（2026年2月20日版，美国政府出版局）",
        "published_at": "2026-02-20",
        "checked_at": "2026-11-09",
        "excerpt": "ERIC A. \"RICK\" CRAWFORD, Republican, of Jonesboro, AR; born on Homestead AFB, FL, January 22, 1966; education: B.A., agricultural business and economics, Arkansas State University, Jonesboro, AR, 1996; military service: explosive ordinance disposal technician, U.S. Army, 1985-89 (retiring with the rank of Sergeant); professional history: professional rodeo announcer; news anchor, KAIT-TV Jonesboro; farm director, KFIN-FM; producer and anchor, Delta Farm Roundup TV Show; marketing manager, John Deere; owner and operator, Agwatch; election history: elected to the 112th Congress on November 2, 2010; reelected to each succeeding Congress.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "url": "https://crawford.house.gov/about-rick",
        "title": "里克·克劳福德众议员官网：About Rick",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-11-09",
        "excerpt": "Rick enlisted in the United States Army straight out of high school. He served as an Explosive Ordnance Disposal Technician, completing four years of service and advancing to the rank of Sergeant. ... he graduated in 1996 with a degree in Agriculture Business and Economics. ... Rick has served on the House Permanent Select Committee on Intelligence since 2017 and was appointed Chairman in January 2025.",
        "tier": 1
      }
